@# Basic authored hubs for civic, transport, and everyday service places.


@entry place.hub.town-square
  @scene place.town-square
  @place-key town_square
  @hub place
@endentry

:: place.town-square [place hub]
@kind place
@heading "Town Square"
@choices "Activities"

The open space of {{place.name}} gives you room to stop and watch the town move around you.

@choice fountain "Sit near the fountain" -> place.town-square
  @icon ⛲
@endchoice

@choice people "Watch the passersby" -> place.town-square
  @icon 👀
@endchoice

@choice leave "Leave" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice



